once by \link{CoxDeviance}. Made by \code{CoxDeviance$information()}.

Besides its methods, the operator works with \code{\%*\%} (on either side, with a
vector or a matrix; R >= 4.4.0), \code{dim()}, \code{nrow()}, \code{ncol()}, \code{t()}
